WEBVTT

53:02.164 --> 53:06.251
It is not a greatsword that is needing
two hands to swing it.

53:06.376 --> 53:10.338
- It's too heavy.
- It is heavy as it needs to be

53:10.464 --> 53:12.215
to make you strong.

53:13.258 --> 53:14.718
Just so.

53:14.843 --> 53:17.137
One hand is all that is needed.

53:18.513 --> 53:20.515
Now you are standing all wrong.

53:20.640 --> 53:22.976
Turn your body sideface.

53:23.101 --> 53:25.353
Yes.

53:25.479 --> 53:27.689
So.

53:27.814 --> 53:30.108
You are skinny. That is good.
